	(text_box "GPIO: IO1/2/4/5 IMON A–D, IO6 VBUS_SENSE (ADC1) · IO7/8/9 CAN TX/RX/STB · IO10–13 POS A–D ·\n  IO14–17 ROW_EN A–D · IO18/21/47/33 FLT A–D · IO39 PD_INT, IO40/41 PD_SCL/SDA, IO42 I2C_PU · IO35 CTL LED ·\n  IO19/20 USB.  Strapping IO3/45/46 unused.\nTermination: two split 2 × 56 Ω + 4.7 nF (56 Ω in all) at the star centre; nodes carry none.\n+5V: buck (5.24 V; ≈ 4.8 V in dropout on a 5 V contract) or USB VBUS through B5819W Schottkys;\n  AP2112K (250 mV dropout) keeps 3.3 V down to a 5 V contract.  The TJA1462AT wants 4.5–5.5 V: CAN runs once VRACK is up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
